# Checks 8 and 9: a structural search wider than one file, with no language.
args: search 'repo:sego-fake/st@v1 patterntype:structural foo(...)'
exit: 0
--- stdout
0 matches  0.1 s
query  repo:sego-fake/st@v1 patterntype:structural foo(...)
--- stderr
sego: note: a structural search over more than one file can miss matches without a +; file:^PATH$ makes it complete, and a regex search marks a cut with +
sego: note: with no lang: and no file: extension, a structural search can parse files as the wrong language and miss matches; lang: names the language
sego: note: at a pinned revision the search can't tell which files it skipped; files over 1 MiB are never searched
